  m_Name: SeaFishWeir
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaFishWeir
  displayName: Fish Weir
  description: A fence of stakes and wicker out into the water that steers fish into
    a trap. A small, steady catch; better with a shoal close by. Its boats go out
    to the fish shoals in reach (silver glints on the water); the richer they are,
    the bigger the catch. Shoals fished hard thin out and move on, and regrow when
    left alone.
